                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Editorial Note</hi></head>
                <p>For text of UN doc. DC/15, United States Working
                    Paper Submitted to the Disarmament Commission: The Bacterial Weapons Question,
                    September 4, 1952, see <hi rendition="#italic">Documents on Disarmament,
                        1945–1959</hi>, volume I, pages 381–382, or Department of State <hi
                        rendition="#italic">Bulletin</hi>, October 27, 1952, pages 671–672.</p>
